  "content": "[Intro]\n[F#m11]\n[E]\n[Dmaj7]\n[E/F]\n[F#m11]\n[E]\n[Dmaj7]\n[E/F]\n\n[Verse]\n[F#m11]Taisetsu na mono wo ubawaresou\n[E]Nichijou ni magirekonda akuma\n[Dmaj7]Heion nara tokku ni kuzure-\n[E/F]satteru\n[F#m11]Nanigenai soshite sarigenai\n[E]Kizukanai uchi ni ubawareteita\n[Dmaj7]Torikaeshi ni iku nara\n[E/F]ima sa Tsuranui-\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Bm7]ta ya no [C#7]you na [F#m]surudo-\nsa de [Bm7]Butsukeau\nkokoro [D/C]wa utsukushii\n[C#7]Dokomademo\n\n[Chorus]\n[Dmaj7]chase you [E/F]Itsumo\n[F#m11]chase you [E]Ore wa\n[Dmaj7]chase you [E/F]Nigeba\n[F#m11]wa nai [E]Hashiridase\n[D#m7b5]chase you [Dmaj7]Asu mo\n[C#m7]chase you [Cmaj7]Tataki-\n[Bm7]tsukete [C#7]yaru no sa\n\n[Outro]\n[C#7][Dmaj7]Shouhai [F#m7]wo\n[C#7][Dmaj7]wakeru no [F#m7]wa\n[C#7][Dmaj7]shuunen [F#m7]sa Dakara\n[Dmaj7]I [C#7]chase [F#m7]you",
